> Applications are invited for a Walk in interview for the following post(s[)] in the project entitled, "Lateral Flow Immunoass[ay based] Point-of-[Care] Oral[ Cancer] Diagn[ostic kit] (OCDk)" at the department of Centre for Nanotechnology, IIT Guwah[ati.]
Cand[idates] have to appear in the Walk in Interview along[ with] an application/CV on plain[ paper giving details] of[ all educational qualifications],[ experience], contact[ address,] phone[ no., E] - mail[ etc.] and submit photocopies[ of] relevant[ documents] at the time of interview on[ 24 Apr 2019] (Wednesday[)] at[ 11]:[00 AM.] Venue: Conference Room, CFN.[][][]

