=== Text #1 ===
> HUGO BOSS is one of the world's best known fashion and luxury[ brands] and are synonymous[ with] a number of sporting and cultural events including sailing, golf and Formula 1. HUGO BOSS targets different,[ clearly] differentiated consumer groups[.] The[ brands] cover an extensive product[ range consisting] of classic-modern business wear, elegant evening and relaxed casual fashion, shoes and leather accessories,[ as] well as licensed fragr[ances], eyewear, watches, children’s fashion and motorcycle[ helmets].[][][][][][]

